  "evaluation_protocol": [
    "The paper evaluates systems on the live sites at evaluation time; ditto evaluates on the frozen snapshot recorded here, so ditto's numbers are not directly comparable with the paper's.",
    "The paper gives systems free-form queries; ditto is given per-site prompted-mode fields.yaml files translated mechanically from those queries (eval/datasets/livewebie/build_fields.py), so attribute identification is not tested.",
    "Field kind follows the query type: type_1/type_2 attributes are scalar, type_3/type_4 attributes are lists; a site using one attribute name both ways gets '<attr>_list' for the list-valued one.",
    "Complexity breakdown: mean field F1 over the fields asked for by each type's queries (field-level), not the paper's per-query precision/recall.",
    "Image and link ground truth are raw @src/@href values (often relative), compared as such.",
    "Pages are labeled only with the fields annotated for their page group."
  ],
  "known_issues": [
    "Release README swaps the Type II/III descriptions; dataset.json follows the paper (type_2 = several single-valued attributes, type_3 = one list-valued attribute).",
    "iclr.cc, icml.cc and neurips.cc g_000 'author' is queried as a list (type_3) but annotated as one ' · '-joined string per page; kept as published.",
    "Some group.jsonl files repeat URLs (4915 listed, 4874 unique); duplicates are fetched once.",
    "Ground-truth values may contain newlines (huggingface.co titles); the parser keeps them."
  ],
